* Original SIMetrix ALB dual-role PIN, tri-state high drive, external pull-down and sensed monitor.
Vext ext 0 PWL(0 0 8n 0 9n 2.15 29n 2.15 30n 5 40n 5 41n 0 50n 0)
Rext ext pin 1k
Voe oe 0 0
Xone pin oe observe TOP
Robserve observe 0 100k
.subckt TOP pin oe monitor
A1 [pin oe] [pin monitor] DL
.model DL d_logic_block file=logic input_load=2p out_res=40 out_delay=2n family="HC"
.file logic
PORT PIN in[0] ;
PORT OE in[1] ;
PORT DRIVE out[0] ;
PORT MON out[1] ;


DRIVE = 1 ;
DRIVE.En = OE ;
MON = PIN ;
.endf
.ends TOP
.tran 20p 50n 0 20p
.PRINT TRAN V(ext) V(pin) V(observe) V(oe)
.end
